# Title: Suspicious File Drop by Exchange
# ID: 6b269392-9eba-40b5-acb6-55c882b20ba6
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2022-10-04
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1190, attack.initial-access, attack.t1505.003
# Description: Detects suspicious file type dropped by an Exchange component in IIS
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog ((process_path="*\\w3wp.exe" AND process_exec="*MSExchange*") AND ((file_name="*.aspx" OR file_name="*.asp" OR file_name="*.ashx" OR file_name="*.ps1" OR file_name="*.bat" OR file_name="*.exe" OR file_name="*.dll" OR file_name="*.vbs")))
